{"title":"2024 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 2b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Answer_Verification\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Answer Verification</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For a positive 3-digit integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eef0203e65664bd00b5f0325c5c5fcd81bcead8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" /> is equal to the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> and the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f536ef84810fcaa7b9f6413d92d1ad490b696ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(351) = 351 + 3 + 5 + 1 = 360$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"251\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Note: The decimal representation of the 3-digit number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96a81938ca5e71faa6894d9d52ac776c9efbe75d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$abc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/6/17667af808852e0182c34d84d2b05a6d58397ffd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\cdot 10^{2} + b \\cdot 10 + c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"142\" height=\"18\" />. For example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02d87822e750ee3434a1de58d897da679d2a5fc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$836 = 8 \\cdot 10^{2} + 3 \\cdot 10 + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"195\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_2b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/8/c287651a783d4316d469c766beb364bba1a57a5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n) = 175$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"89\" height=\"20\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_2b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that the hundreds digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eef0203e65664bd00b5f0325c5c5fcd81bcead8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" /> would otherwise be greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/3/8f37626d49b4082c9102bf930bca51277ff2eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, we can let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/4/5c46d2a1b1a0de4930677cd33c0a4dbd770e818a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 100 + 10a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"144\" height=\"16\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are digits.\n</p><p>Then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/8/c287651a783d4316d469c766beb364bba1a57a5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n) = 175$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"89\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/d/4cd7427ad4f4a90135205eada4b3bbe076f35a4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 + 10a + b + 1 + a + b = 175$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"254\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/7/6f711001ecf3c1cfd127a7a589cbd1648ba8fae6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$101 + 11a + 2b = 175$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"170\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/6/e460dd802028c4f18fef0cd634ab741938455338.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11a + 2b = 175 - 101 = 74$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"212\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> must be between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/8/da8e7e3a4d1116d88e07067fba6082fd45244dcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> would otherwise be greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/f/7af4b3f8897671e2879b10badf471e5deec8952e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$77$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" />, which is more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/1/90100e7ec57be3145070551137e9c47224adb4d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$74$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" />. However, it must also be even because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/b/a9b30259d95f64f9aa7c6bd36e1583618a23c8bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> is even and the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/2/64216bb1bc1be6520b725ffdf15df9030d89fe2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11a + 2b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"16\" /> is even.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/9/b5969c2cfb1ffadf981fbbddcf796c8eb0037546.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 0$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf0953f43c76a5c79f339f9aee0fc2baac51413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f98b3f405113241659d8c8db2ea3480346db4d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eac964e50ab7e4904f600a0a12e157a994617fe4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Of these choices, only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eac964e50ab7e4904f600a0a12e157a994617fe4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> works because if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f98b3f405113241659d8c8db2ea3480346db4d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/4/cd4d3bca55b382308297bc4e69f8cdb1cdd949f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11 \\times 4 + 2b = 74$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"133\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/7/557619af28b1481ac82bad38195505f64cc23b71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b + 44 = 74$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/4/2a43f9b2caef76717a9cc86e596112f4dc02cf0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b = 74 - 44 = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"144\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/9/bb9f0bee32144bc27a3d9521cc651fbaf0fef22f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{30}{2} = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>This is more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, contradicting the idea that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is a digit from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> must be higher than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eac964e50ab7e4904f600a0a12e157a994617fe4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc53fd8e3928a894811741a33f49bf4c0f1ada4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11 \\times 6 + 2b = 74$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"133\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/d/fed84ba55e6d6170c20e2a56ee7b83ccbcce01ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b + 66 = 74$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/c/f7c3d25a63ce984e8267db33dbd9653c3eae1e19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b = 74 - 66 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"135\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efb996ca207df5d210cd86914aed764adb55fcb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eac964e50ab7e4904f600a0a12e157a994617fe4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efb996ca207df5d210cd86914aed764adb55fcb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/a/fca7f7be964a6ff356a5bb58bd147fd138630250.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\boxed{164}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"76\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Answer_Verification\">Answer Verification</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_2b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Answer Verification\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/f/fcfff8b15089aed6d41ab71a7d3a3bd011619c00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 164$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />, we can plug-in our value into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eef0203e65664bd00b5f0325c5c5fcd81bcead8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" /> to make sure that we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/a/caa2c5db610c6d7c961d76200b986305e4f13db0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$175$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/1/b2190c27b6270c278f617c02cc4a90777ee41f5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(164) = 164 + 1 + 6 + 4 = 165 + 10 = 175$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"343\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>This is equal to what we wanted, showing that our value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is correct.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018025843\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 277/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 513/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 10315/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.666      1 2024_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    7.666      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35599:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018025843 and revision id 278013. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}